<div>
  <h2>The Challenge</h2>
  <div class="side-by-side">
    <p>
      1. P3 wanted a sponsorship that went past logo placements and product
      shots. The challenge was to include P3 in real UFC fighter routines so it
      felt like a natural part of their training.
    </p>
    <p>
      2. The features had to put the fighters first and the brand second, with
      P3's message built into the stories so the videos did not feel like
      traditional ads.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

