<div>
  <h2>The Solution</h2>
  <p class="big">A Documentary Approach to Brand Storytelling</p>
  <p>
    Each feature was shot and edited in a behind-the-scenes style that shows
    fans the fighters' daily lives. I have documentary experience, so this style
    was a natural fit. We used training footage, personal interviews and fight
    prep sequences to keep the content raw and real.
  </p>
  <p>
    P3 appears in the fighters' nutrition routines, gym sessions and on-the-go
    moments, with no forced product placement. This presents it as a
    performance-focused brand.
  </p>
</div>

