<div>
  <h2>The Impact</h2>
  <p>
    The series presented P3 as a nutrition brand that elite fighters trust.
    Because the fighters' stories came first, P3 gained credibility in combat
    sports and a closer, longer-term relationship with the UFC.
  </p>
